<section class="section bg-gray" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow">Why iSaral</div>
      <h2 class="h2" id="why-heading">Everything your Indian SME needs, in one platform</h2>
      <p class="lead max-660 mx-auto" style="margin-top:12px">Stop juggling spreadsheets, WhatsApp, and separate tools. iSaral brings GST billing, customer management, orders, and support under one roof — starting at ₹999/month.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#EBF2FF">🇮🇳</div>
        <div class="why-title">Built for India, first</div>
        <p class="why-desc">GST compliance, Indian tax rules (CGST/SGST/IGST), INR billing, Razorpay UPI, mandi receipts — everything is designed for how Indian businesses actually operate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#F0FDF4">⚡</div>
        <div class="why-title">Go live in under a day</div>
        <p class="why-desc">Import your customers from Excel, add your GSTIN, and send your first GST invoice within hours — not weeks. No lengthy implementation roadmap required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#FFF7ED">💰</div>
        <div class="why-title">Fraction of the cost</div>
        <p class="why-desc">Starting at ₹999/month — a fraction of what enterprise software costs. No hidden charges, no per-user fees on lower plans, no surprise bills.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#FFF0F0">🔒</div>
        <div class="why-title">Your data stays in India</div>
        <p class="why-desc">Data hosted on AWS Mumbai region. RBI-friendly, DPDP Act compliant, daily encrypted backups. Your customer data, invoices never leave Indian soil.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#F5F3FF">📞</div>
        <div class="why-title">Real support in Hindi &amp; English</div>
        <p class="why-desc">Our support team works in Indian time zones, 9 AM – 9 PM IST. Real humans in Hindi and English — not a chatbot, not an overseas call centre.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-icon" style="background:#ECFDF5">📱</div>
        <div class="why-title">Works on any device</div>
        <p class="why-desc">Full-featured mobile experience for Android and iOS. Create invoices, track orders, and resolve tickets from your smartphone anywhere, anytime.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


```html
<section class="section" id="testimonials" aria-labelledby="testi-heading">

  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="sec-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow">Customer Success Stories</div>
      <h2 class="h2" id="testi-heading">
        5,000+ Indian businesses trust iSaral
      </h2>

      <p class="lead max-660 mx-auto" style="margin-top:12px">
        From consultants and service providers to growing SMEs —
        businesses across India use iSaral to simplify billing,
        CRM, support, and collections.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-grid">

      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->

      <div class="testi-card">

        <div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div>

        <p class="testi-text">
          "We switched from Excel-based invoicing to iSaral.
          Invoice creation now takes less than a minute and our
          payment collections improved dramatically through Razorpay integration."
        </p>

        <div class="testi-author">

          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?w=300&q=80"
            alt="Rahul Khanna"
            class="testi-photo"
          >

          <div>
            <div class="testi-name">Rahul Khanna</div>

            <div class="testi-role">
              Founder & CEO
            </div>

            <div class="testi-company">
              TechFlow Solutions · Bangalore
            </div>

            <div class="testi-result">
              ↑ 70% Faster Collections
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->

      <div class="testi-card">

        <div class="testi-stars">★★★★★</div>

        <p class="testi-text">
          "The CRM pipeline transformed our sales process.
          Automated follow-ups and lead tracking helped us
          improve conversion rates and never miss an opportunity."
        </p>

        <div class="testi-author">

          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=300&q=80"
            alt="Priya Mehta"
            class="testi-photo"
          >

